BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:LiveMusicAsheville.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260717T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260718T000000
DTSTAMP:20260715T173941Z
CREATED:20260715T112600Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260715T173941Z
UID:10078827-1784318400-1784332800@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Old Sap-Full Band
DESCRIPTION:Old Sap—poet from Chicago\, rambled out to Montana\, cut a banjo from a tamarack\, strings across the country\, foot like a freight train\, voice rushing down over lush Appalachia\, sings a thrush tune through the rush hour and into your long-forgotten prairie dreams. Folk. Folk Rock. Americana. \n  \nThis show finds Old Sap joined by an eccentric ensemble of Asheville’s best—Quinn Sternberg on bass\, Jacob Bruner on keys and trombone\, Jacob Baumann on drums\, Shane O’Brien on guitar\, and Lyndsay Pruett on fiddle. Take a tour through over a century of music—from blues and jazz roots to psychedelia to spoken word to original tunes fished out of streams and plucked from peach trees—all wrapped in a rhythm machine finely tuned for you to dance your kneecaps off.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/old-sap-full-band/
LOCATION:One World Brewing – West\, 520 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/746463312_1712743953184878_1716109521075105418_n-e1784137163289.jpg
GEO:35.5783642;-82.5848526
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=One World Brewing – West 520 Haywood Rd Asheville North Carolina 28806;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=520 Haywood Rd:geo:-82.5848526,35.5783642
END:VEVENT
